{"hymn":"S136","parent":"E175","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":2},"title":"¡Bello Señor Jesús","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su belleza","syl":{"n1":["¡Be","i"],"n2":["llo","t"],"n3":"Se‿ñor","n4":["Je","i"],"n6":["sús!","t"],"n7":["¡De‿es","i"],"n8":["te‿u","m"],"n9":["ni","m"],"n10":["ver","m"],"n11":["so‿el","t"],"n13":"Rey!","n14":["¡Tú‿e","i"],"n15":["res","t"],"n16":["Hi","i"],"n17":["jo","t"],"n18":"del","n20":["Hom","i"],"n21":["bre‿y","t"],"n22":"Dios!","n23":["Siem","i"],"n24":["pre","t"],"n25":["te‿a","i"],"n26":["pre‿cia","m"],"n28":["ré,","t"],"n29":["Siem","i"],"n30":["pre","t"],"n31":["te‿hon","i"],"n32":["ra","m"],"n34":["ré,","t"],"n35":"Mi","n36":["glo","i"],"n37":["ria","t"],"n38":["e","i"],"n39":["res","t"],"n40":"Tú,","n41":["Se","i"],"n42":["ñor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["¡Qué bello el campo es!","La floresta más aún,","En su belleza primaveral;","Más bello‿es el Señor,","Más puro en Su‿amor,","Que hace‿al triste ser cantar."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Bella‿es la luz del sol,","Y la luna‿en su esplendor,","O las estrellas al centellear;","Jesús es superior,","Brilla con más fulgor","Que luz o ser angelical."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Belleza terrenal,","Hermosura celestial,","Lo más hermoso es mi Señor;","Excelso‿y sin igual,","Y de‿un valor sin par,","Es mi querido Salvador."]}]}